SF0170 Grizzly bear management prohibition.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Hicks and Driskill and Representative(s)
Hoeft and Winter
AN ACT relating to game and fish; limiting the actions the game and fish
department and commission may take in the management of grizzly bears; requiring
rulemaking; and providing for an effective date.
